comments.body:
Sure, but my thinking is that init-lists for CTransaction must always end in a trailing comma:

```cpp
auto tx = CTransaction{
    {},
    {
        CTxOut{nValues[0], CScript{} << ToByteVector(key[0].GetPubKey()) << OP_CHECKSIG},
        CTxOut{nValues[1], CScript{} << ToByteVector(key[1].GetPubKey()) << OP_CHECKSIG},
    },
};
```

But again, up to other reviewers to pick the side here :sweat_smile:

